{
  "description": "This is one of three protocols updated from protocols developed with Protocol Designer. The three protocols are:\n48 MCT to 1mL Vial\n48 Samples to MCT\nEtOH 48 Sample to 1mL Vial\n\nIn this protocol, the p300-single channel pipette is used to transfer 300µL between the acrylic Opentrons tuberack and a custom 1mL tube rack.\n\n\n\nTo purchase tips, reagents, or pipettes, please visit our online store or contact our sales team at info@opentrons.com\n\nP300 Single-Channel Pipette (GEN1)\nOpentrons 300µl Pipette tips\nOpentrons Acrylic Tube Rack\nCustom 1mL Tube Rack + Tubes\n\n\n\nDeck Layout\n\nSlot 2: Opentrons Acrylic Tube Rack (for samples 1-24)\n\nSlot 3: Custom 1mL Tube Rack + Tubes (for samples 1-24)\n\nSlot 5: Opentrons Acrylic Tube Rack (for samples 25-48)\n\nSlot 6: Custom 1mL Tube Rack + Tubes (for samples 25-48)\n\nSlot 7: Opentrons 300µl Pipette tips",
